-- quiet: the §11.12 module fixture. Its only machine is a one-shot
-- that dies, and it declares no Error block — so importing it
-- installs the module's default Error machine (Error ++ suffix),
-- which is idle-exempt and must not keep the run alive after the
-- importer's machines are gone. See MachineSpec/ModuleSpec §11.12
-- tests and agent-history/messageboard/sleep-experiment/ (finding 5).
: die
